      "file": "winrt/windows.devices.bluetooth.genericattributeprofile.h",
      "finding": "ValueChanged(event_token) projection is noexcept and discards remove_ValueChanged HRESULT. Production checked_remove invokes the same generated interface ABI with check_hresult, preserving tokens on a failed native remove."
